[
  {
    "SSID": "YourNetwork",
    "BSSID": "aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff",
    "security": "WPA2"
  }
]

This JSON serves as an example trusted access point baseline for WiFiWatch.
It allows users to specify their legitimate Wi-Fi network's SSID, BSSID, and security type so the tool can compare discovered 
access points against the trusted baseline and identify possible rogue or impersonating access points.
